#G(384,030,032,030)016(024,053)
#L(056,050)| Now that you have selected an army|
#L(056,070)| you'll probably want to move it!|
#F007
#L(016,095)|When you move the cursor around the map,|
#L(016,115)|you will see it change into either a pair|
#L(016,135)|of feet - over land - or a boat - over water.|
#L(016,155)|To move your army towards the cursor, simply|
#L(016,175)|left-click.|
#F015
#L(016,200)|If your army runs out of movement on the|
#L(016,220)|way to where you clicked, it will remember|
#L(016,240)|where it was heading on your next turn.|
#F007
#L(016,260)|To make an army continue down its path -|
#L(016,280)|shown in black circles - click the "feet" button|
#L(016,300)|on the bottom right of the screen.|
